@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070/api

### Opret en pakke
POST {{baseUrl}}/parcels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": 1,
  "senderName": "Emil Ozel",
  "recipientName": "Bo Jensen",
  "destinationAddress": "Amperestien 10, 2605 Brøndby"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("parcelId", response.body.id);
    client.global.set("trackingNumber", response.body.trackingNumber);
%}

### Hent alle pakker
GET {{baseUrl}}/parcels
Accept: application/json

### Hent pakker for én bruger
GET {{baseUrl}}/parcels?ownerId=1
Accept: application/json

### Hent en pakke med trackingnummeret fra oprettelsen
GET {{baseUrl}}/parcels/tracking/{{trackingNumber}}
Accept: application/json

### Registrer at pakken er afhentet
POST {{baseUrl}}/parcels/{{parcelId}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PICKED_UP",
  "location": "Brøndby",
  "message": "Pakken er blevet afhentet"
}

### Hent pakkens historik
GET {{baseUrl}}/parcels/{{parcelId}}/events
Accept: application/json

### Denne sletning giver 409 efter PICKED_UP
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/parcels/{{parcelId}}
